  "bio": "Jeff Jibran, owner of \"IDLE HANDS\" in Jacksonville, Florida, is a highly skilled tattoo artist specializing in Japanese and traditional styles. With an impressive 18 years of experience, his extensive travels from Japan to Miami have honed his craftsmanship, making him a sought-after inksmith in the tattoo community. His portfolio, rich with intricate designs and vibrant colors, is a testament to his exceptional skill level and dedication to the art of tattooing.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nIDLE HANDS\n 904-647-5183 owner\nJeffjibran@gmail.com \nWorld traveler inksmith&Rogers18yrs Japan Amsterdam Denmark Tokyo Germany Ireland Miami San Diego\n\nIDLE HANDS\n 904-647-5183 owner\nJeffjibran@gmail.com \nWorld traveler inksmith&Rogers18yrs Japan Amsterdam Denmark Tokyo Germany Ireland Miami San Diego",
